sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant AuthScreen
    participant AuthVM as AuthViewModel
    participant UseCase as LoginUseCase
    participant Repo as AuthRepository
    participant API as AuthApi
    participant Backend as Spring Boot
    participant JWT as JWT Provider
    participant AuthMgr as AuthManager
    participant Storage as TokenStorage

    Note over User,Storage: Login Flow

    User->>AuthScreen: Enter email + password, tap Login
    AuthScreen->>AuthVM: onIntent(Submit)
    AuthVM->>UseCase: login(email, password)
    UseCase->>UseCase: Validate non-blank
    UseCase->>Repo: login(email, password)
    Repo->>API: POST /auth/login {email, password}
    API->>Backend: HTTP request (no auth header)
    Backend->>Backend: Verify credentials
    Backend->>JWT: Generate token (HS256, 15min TTL)
    JWT-->>Backend: accessToken
    Backend-->>API: 200 {accessToken, userId}
    API-->>Repo: AuthResponseDto
    Repo->>AuthMgr: login(token, userId)
    AuthMgr->>Storage: saveToken(token, userId)
    AuthMgr->>AuthMgr: _state = Authenticated(token, userId)
    Repo-->>UseCase: ApiResult.Success
    UseCase-->>AuthVM: Success
    AuthVM-->>AuthScreen: Effect: NavigateToHome

    Note over User,Storage: App recomposes: AuthState.Authenticated -> MainApp()

    Note over User,Storage: Cold Start Restoration

    AuthMgr->>Storage: getToken(), getUserId()
    Storage-->>AuthMgr: token, userId (or null)
    AuthMgr->>AuthMgr: _state = Authenticated or Unauthenticated

    Note over User,Storage: Token Expiry (401 on any API call)

    API->>Backend: GET /notes (expired token)
    Backend-->>API: 401 Unauthorized
    API-->>Repo: Error
    Repo->>AuthMgr: logout()
    AuthMgr->>Storage: clear()
    AuthMgr->>AuthMgr: _state = Unauthenticated

    Note over User,Storage: App recomposes: AuthState.Unauthenticated -> AuthScreen
